# Your own data, if you run the toolkit from inside this checkout (root = repo root).
# examples/demo/config.json is a tracked exception — it's part of the shipped demo, not user data.
/config.json
/profile/
/master/
/applications/
/produced/
/workspace/

# Rendered output is a build artifact everywhere except the one committed demo hero image.
**/generate-pdfs/

# Per-company generated CV markdown regenerates from application.md on demand; the demo's copy
# ships tracked (examples/demo/expected/ + the file itself) so the shape is visible without a
# build step, but a real user's own applications/ tree is already covered by /applications/ above.

# Node / Python housekeeping.
node_modules/
package-lock.json.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
